msgstr ""
"如果您不小心關閉或移動了 dock，導致找不到它，有幾個簡單的解決方法。首先，您可以使用螢幕頂端的 :guilabel:`View->Simple "
"View` 選單選項，將視圖還原為預設狀態。或者，您也可以使用 :guilabel:`View->Docks->...` 選單來顯示或隱藏主視窗上的特定"
" dock 小工具。"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Snapping toggles magnetic alignment. Timing Tool enables retiming by "
#~ "dragging clip edges. Razor Tool cuts clips at the clicked position."
#~ msgstr "吸附切換磁性對齊。時間工具可透過拖曳剪輯邊緣來重新定時。剃刀工具可在點擊位置切割剪輯。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Use :guilabel:`Help→About OpenShot` to check your OpenShot version. Click "
#~ ":guilabel:`Copy` next to the version number to copy a short version and "
#~ "system details report, which is the preferred way to share this information "
#~ "when reporting a bug or asking for help."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "使用 :guilabel:`說明→關於 OpenShot` 來檢查您的 OpenShot 版本。點擊版本號旁的 :guilabel:`複製` "
#~ "可複製簡短版本與系統詳細報告，這是回報錯誤或尋求協助時推薦的資訊分享方式。"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
